は好き嫌い多いのかな??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい頃よりは多くないけど、んー好き嫌いがはっきりしとるのは確か。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シーフード類はほっとんど苦手です('・ω・`)ごめんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いものは何でも好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"498"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通のサウナとか岩盤浴とかはいったことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありますよ(^o^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末にかわごってぃ（川後陽菜chan）と２人で行きました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉に入ってるおさるさんになった気分で楽しかったよねーかわごってぃー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"499"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男の人の好きな髪型とかあります!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってれば何でもステキだと思う(^^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"500"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな卒業合唱曲は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鉄板でごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「旅立ちの日に」♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"501"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話派メール派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話派(^ω^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元の友達にも、いきなり電話しだすってゆーね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"502"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"江田島市の、能美海上ロッジの温泉は行った事ありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ったことないです('・ω・``)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平成８年生まれですよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉もひめたんも15歳なんだね∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの方が４ヶ月くらい先輩みたいぢゃけどね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"503"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺の故郷熊本はね、納豆消費量が西日本でNo.1なのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西日本はわりと納豆嫌いな地域が多いけどね。ひめたん、知ってた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめて知った(・∀・)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへー熊本県行ったことない行ってみたいー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"504"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもさくら学院SUN見てますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが見たことないんですごめんなさい('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さ学のみんな大好きなんです!だから見たいなって思っとるんじゃけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島では放送してなくて...東京ではテレビみる時間がなくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。なるべく見ます(`・・)ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"505"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し大変じゃないですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいからお返事するんです(*・ω・*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"506"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13日にHEY!HEY!HEY!出演って書いとかないと〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"情報には疎いもので...ごめんなさい('・ω・`)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付け足しておきまする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"507"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは親父ギャグを許せますか？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやじぎゃく。可愛いと思います(o>ω<o)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"508"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ握手会だね。ひめたんはファンの前だと緊張する方？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いざ顔みたら緊張しちゃって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話したかったことぽーんって飛んでっちゃう('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでも楽しみにしとるです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"509"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生になったら何したいとかある？(^^♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力あげる(*^^*)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お料理とか、お裁縫とか、特訓することにしますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今よりもっとアイドルらしいアイドルになるよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"510"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部活は入るのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入りたいなーとか思いつつ。検討中なう＼(^ω^)／!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"511"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはMAX何時間起きてたことあるん？笑っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーる＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からの朝方爆睡したから、結果26時間とかだと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"512"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然電話するってことは1回は短いの？それとも長電話しちゃう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんるん（斎藤ちはるchan）はいっつも会っとるけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あえて話題が思い浮かばんかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本電話しだしたら長いと思う('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからって深い話では決してないんだけれども。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q7.あなたのうまれたところはどこですかー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白地図みてね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーしっかし、いろんなとこに散らばってるね！おもしろーいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの故郷ツアーしたーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北をぴんくにしたいなー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/9617288/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん(*´・ω・*)"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-48616":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"       明けましておめでとうございます！ 新内眞衣です。     "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF8YZ42Q8861W2ARR8JR497","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">       昨年は大変お世話になりました！   たくさんお仕事をさせていただけたし たくさん海外にも行かせていただけて   本当に幸せな1年でした。     締めくくりには 輝く！日本レコード大賞の 大賞を受賞させていただき 本当に嬉しかったです◎   "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF8Z0B0KTBFTPQ6KSMHBHR9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">   レコード大賞の時の衣装が 本当に好き！     2年連続ということで 2017年の大賞を取っての 2018年だったので 本当にこの賞の重みを感じてます。   ありがとうございました！         そして   紅白歌合戦も ありがとうございました！   お正月に実家に帰ったら 今年もおばあちゃんが見てくれていて 喜んでた◎ おばあちゃん孝行ですな(^^)       そしてそして   "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF8Z1PH603RMR3TKQBT8K68","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">     なーちゃん卒業おめでとう◎ まだライブもあるし 本当に実感は湧きませんが   寂しいです...     帰り道は遠回りしたくなるの MVでは1日目の最後のシーンが あのカラオケでした。   終わって いつものように着替えながら 次の日はダンスシーンだったから   また数時間後にねって 笑い合ってたのが懐かしい(;_;)     大好きなこの曲で紅白に出場出来て 幸せでした。   披露出来るのはあと1回なのかな。 寂しいね。     こらからもなーちゃんの未来が 幸せでありますように！                 お知らせ     "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF8Z2Z3330K6N3GRRZZYYVQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">   明日深夜0:00～は 乃木坂工事中1時間スペシャルです！   晴れ着きてドタバタしました！ 見てね～◎       それでは今日はこのへんで。     "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF8Z423NWF388XPB7TF4FR5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">   今年も餃子をたくさん 食べられますように。   また書きます！            "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-52505":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHWS9ASQG54RKHGVM042JMR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHWSABHZ3RAQ2EFJPB4HJMM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHWSBCJXDF5S5P3ZTTC6R5T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHWSCD1F9GQKJD849RNEE9V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHWSDCH7ZBZ2FC5600YEZQS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":